 independently make anaesthetic decisions reserved for qualified anaesthesia professionals."},{"type":"h","text":"Technology & Digital OT"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern operating theatres use increasingly sophisticated technology."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electronic medical records"},{"text":"OT scheduling systems"},{"text":"Digital surgical documentation"},{"text":"Equipment tracking"},{"text":"Instrument tracking"},{"text":"Barcode/RFID systems"},{"text":"Digital sterilization records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Robotic surgery systems"},{"text":"Laparoscopic systems"},{"text":"Surgical navigation"},{"text":"Electrosurgical equipment"},{"text":"Advanced patient-monitoring systems"},{"text":"AI-assisted surgical systems"},{"text":"Smart operating rooms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Data Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"AI is becoming increasingly relevant to perioperative operations."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OT scheduling optimization"},{"text":"Surgical workflow analytics"},{"text":"Equipment maintenance prediction"},{"text":"Instrument tracking"},{"text":"Infection-control analytics"},{"text":"Operating-room utilization analysis"},{"text":"Predictive resource planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful Technical Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Healthcare information systems"},{"text":"AI literacy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"}]},{"heading":"Smart OT Inventory System","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Surgical instruments"},{"text":"Equipment"},{"text":"Consumables"},{"text":"Sterilization status"},{"text":"Availability"}]}]},{"heading":"OT Scheduling Optimization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a prototype that analyzes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procedure duration"},{"text":"OT availability"},{"text":"Equipment requirements"},{"text":"Surgical-team availability"}]}]},{"heading":"Surgical Instrument Tracking System","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Use barcode/RFID concepts to track:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Instrument","Cleaning","Sterilization","Storage","OT Issue","Procedure","Return"]}]},{"heading":"OT Infection-Control Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Monitor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OT cleaning"},{"text":"Sterilization cycles"},{"text":"Equipment checks"},{"text":"Infection indicators"},{"text":"Compliance records"}]}]},{"heading":"End-to-End Smart Operating Theatre","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Patient","OT Scheduling","Preoperative Checklist","Equipment Preparation","Sterilization Verification","Surgery","Instrument Tracking","Recovery","Digital Documentation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship & Clinical Training Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical exposure is essential."},{"type":"h","text":"1. General Surgery OT"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"Sterility"},{"text":"Positioning"},{"text":"Surgical workflow"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Orthopaedic OT"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Specialized instruments"},{"text":"Implants"},{"text":"Power tools"},{"text":"Positioning"},{"text":"Sterile workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Obstetric & Gynaecology OT"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emergency surgical workflow"},{"text":"Caesarean procedures"},{"text":"Specialized instrumentation"},{"text":"Rapid OT preparation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Anaesthesia Department"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Anaesthesia machines"},{"text":"Airway equipment"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Recov